  "job_B9.2.7_20251003_115004": {
    "chunk_text": "He him bebead \u00fe\u00e6t he forlete \u00feone his cristendom o\u00f0\u00f0e his folga\u00f0. \u00dea w\u00e6s him leofre \u00fe\u00e6t he forlete his folga\u00f0 \u00feonne \u00feone cristendom; ac him gefylste God eft to Ra\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6s he gesealde Ualente his bre\u00f0er healf his rice. & he het ofslean Percopiosus, \u00fee \u00fea ricsian wolde, & monege o\u00f0re mid him. Ualens w\u00e6s gel\u00e6red from anum Arrianiscan biscepe, Eudoxius w\u00e6s haten, ac he hit h\u00e6l swi\u00f0e On \u00fe\u00e6m ilcan geare Godenric, Gotena cyning, gedyde fela martyra on his \u00feeode cristenra On \u00fe\u00e6m dagum Ualentinianus geniedde eft \u00fea Seaxan to hiera agnum lande, \u00fea hie woldon & Burgendum he gestierde eac \u00fe\u00e6t hie on Gallie ne wunnon; mid \u00fe\u00e6m him w\u00e6s swi\u00feost On \u00fe\u00e6m enleftan geare his rices Sermende hergedon on Pannoniam; \u00fea he \u00feiderweard w\u00e6s mid \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s M wintra & an hund & XXVIIII, feng Ualens, He \u00fea Ualens o\u00f0ewde openlice \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00e6r diegellice gehyd h\u00e6fde, swa \u00fe\u00e6t he bebead \u00fe\u00e6t & sende on Egypte & het toweorpan eal \u00fea munuclif \u00fee his bro\u00f0or \u00e6r gesta\u00feelade; & sume \u00fea On \u00fe\u00e6m dagum Firmus w\u00e6s haten sum mon on Africum, se w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6r wilniende \u00fe\u00e6s onwaldes. \u00dea sende Ualens \u00feider Theodosius his ealdormon mid fierde, \u00fe\u00e6s godan \u00feeodosiuses f\u00e6der, \u00fee On \u00fe\u00e6m f\u00e6relte Firmus wear\u00f0 gefangen, &",
